      "type": "code",
      "depth": null,
      "line": 90,
      "raw": "```python\ndef f(x):\n    return 2 * d2l.sin(x) + x**0.8\n\ny_train = f(x_train) + d2l.normal(0.0, 0.5, (n_train,))  # 训练样本的输出\nx_test = d2l.arange(0, 5, 0.1)  # 测试样本\ny_truth = f(x_test)  # 测试样本的真实输出\nn_test = len(x_test)  # 测试样本数\nn_test\n```",
