    {
      "id": "nadaraya-waston-019",
      "sha256": "b4702a233b156e195affae95df209f3b30870936029e6b6e998e8e875d8aba4a",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "depth": null,
      "line": 170,
      "raw": "显然，平均汇聚忽略了输入$x_i$。\n于是Nadaraya [原文引用：Nadaraya.1964](https://zh.d2l.ai/chapter_attention-mechanisms/nadaraya-waston.html)和\nWatson [原文引用：Watson.1964](https://zh.d2l.ai/chapter_attention-mechanisms/nadaraya-waston.html)提出了一个更好的想法，\n根据输入的位置对输出$y_i$进行加权：",
      "math": {
        "expected": 2,
        "rendered": 2,
        "errors": 0,
        "pending": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "nadaraya-waston-020",
      "sha256": "1ecc05fa670507c234184c7041e32a7fc82e9991508bea48c0e2dc250a1112aa",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "depth": null,
      "line": 175,
      "raw": "$$f(x) = \\sum_{i=1}^n \\frac{K(x - x_i)}{\\sum_{j=1}^n K(x - x_j)} y_i,$$",
      "math": {
        "expected": 1,
        "rendered": 1,
        "errors": 0,
        "pending": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "nadaraya-waston-021",
      "sha256": "64e173d315a5bb295f6f88d1b512050d30af8fc9e992b6c2e43cbf218225788b",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "depth": null,
      "line": 177,
      "raw": "其中$K$是*核*（kernel）。\n公式 [原文引用：eq_nadaraya-watson](https://zh.d2l.ai/chapter_attention-mechanisms/nadaraya-waston.html)所描述的估计器被称为\n*Nadaraya-Watson核回归*（Nadaraya-Watson kernel regression）。\n这里不会深入讨论核函数的细节，\n但受此启发，\n我们可以从 [原文引用：fig_qkv](https://zh.d2l.ai/chapter_attention-mechanisms/nadaraya-waston.html)中的注意力机制框架的角度\n重写 [原文引用：eq_nadaraya-watson](https://zh.d2l.ai/chapter_attention-mechanisms/nadaraya-waston.html)，\n成为一个更加通用的*注意力汇聚*（attention pooling）公式：",
      "math": {
        "expected": 1,
        "rendered": 1,
        "errors": 0,
        "pending": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "nadaraya-waston-022",
      "sha256": "dc7fed2e863d34116e45ceb62952a7064d48e866a35f94f82ea4e2fdd187cae4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "depth": null,
      "line": 186,
      "raw": "$$f(x) = \\sum_{i=1}^n \\alpha(x, x_i) y_i,$$",
      "math": {
        "expected": 1,
        "rendered": 1,
        "errors": 0,
        "pending": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "nadaraya-waston-023",
      "sha256": "9f57bf2d1d5fdeabdbf42688dacb941cb9f005a52f0bf08ff6848d20f964c667",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "depth": null,
      "line": 188,
      "raw": "其中$x$是查询，$(x_i, y_i)$是键值对。\n比较 [原文引用：eq_attn-pooling](https://zh.d2l.ai/chapter_attention-mechanisms/nadaraya-waston.html)和 [原文引用：eq_avg-pooling](https://zh.d2l.ai/chapter_attention-mechanisms/nadaraya-waston.html)，\n注意力汇聚是$y_i$的加权平均。\n将查询$x$和键$x_i$之间的关系建模为\n*注意力权重*（attention weight）$\\alpha(x, x_i)$，\n如 [原文引用：eq_attn-pooling](https://zh.d2l.ai/chapter_attention-mechanisms/nadaraya-waston.html)所示，\n这个权重将被分配给每一个对应值$y_i$。\n对于任何查询，模型在所有键值对注意力权重都是一个有效的概率分布：\n它们是非负的，并且总和为1。",
      "math": {
        "expected": 7,
        "rendered": 7,
        "errors": 0,
        "pending": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "nadaraya-waston-024",
      "sha256": "baf4a655f6baacc7412a731fb3520c606e4772d607af7b194dcaeee7480eedba",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "depth": null,
      "line": 198,
      "raw": "为了更好地理解注意力汇聚，\n下面考虑一个*高斯核*（Gaussian kernel），其定义为：",
      "math": {
        "expected": 0,
        "rendered": 0,
        "errors": 0,
        "pending": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "nadaraya-waston-025",
      "sha256": "01e7a4acb74cc2fef7edba85892771ca61e690143dc67dfcf587bd6c8632908b",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "depth": null,
      "line": 201,
      "raw": "$$K(u) = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}} \\exp(-\\frac{u^2}{2}).$$",
      "math": {
        "expected": 1,
        "rendered": 1,
        "errors": 0,
        "pending": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "nadaraya-waston-026",
      "sha256": "a9f8764f45b4a9a16b381013b4522a2777026700f0fe88d082e46d582977bf84",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "depth": null,
      "line": 203,
      "raw": "将高斯核代入 [原文引用：eq_attn-pooling](https://zh.d2l.ai/chapter_attention-mechanisms/nadaraya-waston.html)和\n [原文引用：eq_nadaraya-watson](https://zh.d2l.ai/chapter_attention-mechanisms/nadaraya-waston.html)可以得到：",
      "math": {
        "expected": 0,
        "rendered": 0,
        "errors": 0,
        "pending": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "nadaraya-waston-027",
      "sha256": "f2980ddf6bbfa340486d8f7a73a2d5ccded6cd1e1703202cd51bb7843f1cd6c9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "depth": null,
      "line": 206,
      "raw": "$$\\begin{aligned} f(x) &=\\sum_{i=1}^n \\alpha(x, x_i) y_i\\\\ &= \\sum_{i=1}^n \\frac{\\exp\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}(x - x_i)^2\\right)}{\\sum_{j=1}^n \\exp\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}(x - x_j)^2\\right)} y_i \\\\&= \\sum_{i=1}^n \\mathrm{softmax}\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}(x - x_i)^2\\right) y_i. \\end{aligned}$$",
      "math": {
        "expected": 1,
        "rendered": 1,
        "errors": 0,
        "pending": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "nadaraya-waston-028",
      "sha256": "06a2ef5153d3bec7e8a7326fe397894b6622f73eb2f0e6c7d698d665187547e9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "depth": null,
      "line": 208,
      "raw": "在 [原文引用：eq_nadaraya-watson-gaussian](https://zh.d2l.ai/chapter_attention-mechanisms/nadaraya-waston.html)中，\n如果一个键$x_i$越是接近给定的查询$x$，\n那么分配给这个键对应值$y_i$的注意力权重就会越大，\n也就“获得了更多的注意力”。",
      "math": {
        "expected": 3,
        "rendered": 3,
        "errors": 0,
        "pending": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "nadaraya-waston-029",
      "sha256": "198842474b5e3f553cbc0f57fc92cb5f284b4c0a5fbeb1b24ddc468db271ae2f",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "depth": null,
      "line": 213,
      "raw": "值得注意的是，Nadaraya-Watson核回归是一个非参数模型。\n因此， [原文引用：eq_nadaraya-watson-gaussian](https://zh.d2l.ai/chapter_attention-mechanisms/nadaraya-waston.html)是\n*非参数的注意力汇聚*（nonparametric attention pooling）模型。\n接下来，我们将基于这个非参数的注意力汇聚模型来绘制预测结果。\n从绘制的结果会发现新的模型预测线是平滑的，并且比平均汇聚的预测更接近真实。",
      "math": {
        "expected": 0,
        "rendered": 0,
        "errors": 0,
        "pending": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "nadaraya-waston-030",
      "sha256": "b59783abb0cfeffe7b2a2a304ebd29813ab4307532c1e7104a94c56803a7b1eb",
      "type": "code",
      "depth": null,
      "line": 231,
      "raw": "```python\n# X_repeat的形状:(n_test,n_train),\n# 每一行都包含着相同的测试输入（例如：同样的查询）\nX_repeat = d2l.reshape(x_test.repeat_interleave(n_train), (-1, n_train))\n# x_train包含着键。attention_weights的形状：(n_test,n_train),\n# 每一行都包含着要在给定的每个查询的值（y_train）之间分配的注意力权重\nattention_weights = nn.functional.softmax(-(X_repeat - x_train)**2 / 2, dim=1)\n# y_hat的每个元素都是值的加权平均值，其中的权重是注意力权重\ny_hat = d2l.matmul(attention_weights, y_train)\nplot_kernel_reg(y_hat)\n```",
      "math": {
        "expected": 0,
