      "type": "paragraph",
      "depth": null,
      "line": 307,
      "raw": "例如，与 [原文引用：eq_nadaraya-watson-gaussian](https://zh.d2l.ai/chapter_attention-mechanisms/nadaraya-waston.html)略有不同，\n在下面的查询$x$和键$x_i$之间的距离乘以可学习参数$w$：",
      "math": {
        "expected": 3,
        "rendered": 3,
        "errors": 0,
        "pending": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "nadaraya-waston-036",
      "sha256": "d513873d1391e50f5e6cfa9c3746d87c09c14958febab9e70b3e0d70bb2b9163",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "depth": null,
      "line": 310,
      "raw": "$$\\begin{aligned}f(x) &= \\sum_{i=1}^n \\alpha(x, x_i) y_i \\\\&= \\sum_{i=1}^n \\frac{\\exp\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}((x - x_i)w)^2\\right)}{\\sum_{j=1}^n \\exp\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}((x - x_j)w)^2\\right)} y_i \\\\&= \\sum_{i=1}^n \\mathrm{softmax}\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}((x - x_i)w)^2\\right) y_i.\\end{aligned}$$",
      "math": {
        "expected": 1,
        "rendered": 1,
        "errors": 0,
